001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.          SRSPRTS.
001300 AUTHOR.              BUNN / BARBARA WINTER.
001400 DATE-WRITTEN.        MARCH 16, 1982.
001500 DATE-COMPILED.
001600*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
001700*REMARKS.
001800*D       THIS PROGRAM REPRINTS A RECEIVING SLIP.
001900*
002000*        PROCESSING OUTLINE.
002100*        1.  THE SCREEN IS WRITTEN ASKING FOR THE RECEIVING
002200*            SLIP NUMBER.
002300*        2.  VALIDATE THE RECEIVING SLIP NUMBER.
002400*        3.  REPRINT THE RECEIVING SLIP.
002500*        4.  NO UPDATES TO THE DATABASE.
002600*
002700*
002800*        THERE ARE SOME DIFFERENCES BETWEEN THE REPRINT AND
002900*        THE ACTUAL RECEIVING SLIP. AS FOLLOWS:
003000*           1.  NO RECEIVED UM IS PRINTED ON THE REPRINT.
003100*               (NOT STORED IN DATABASE).
003200*           2.  THE COMMENT FIELD OF THE FREIGHT INFORMATION
003300*               DOES NOT PRINT (NOT STORED IN DATABASE).
      *******************************************************************
      *C*****************************************************************
      *C MAY 21, 1992  -  JEFF BUNGO    (005979)                        *
      *C      CHANGED THE LINKAGE SECTION, PROCEDURE DIVISION USING     *
      *C      STATEMENT, AND THE PARAMETERS FOR CRSPRT.  CHANGE WAS     *
      *C      MADE TO PASS THE MMISA DATABASE BASE FROM TUDCDOCK AND    *
      *C      PASS IT TO CRSPRT TO ALLOW CRSPRT TO ACCESS AN MMISA      *
      *C      DATABASE FILE (PER-PERSONNEL).                            *
      *C
      *C JANUARY 25, 1995  - JEFF BUNGO
      *C      DETIRMINE IF PO ENTERED HAS RAW MATERIALS AND SET FLAG
      *C      TO PRINT TO RAW MATERIAL PRINTER.  LINKAGE SECTION
      *C      CHANGED TO INCLUDE PASSING RAW MATERIAL GROUPS FROM
      *C      PROGRAM TUDCDOCK.
      *C
      *C JUNE 6, 1996 - JEFF BUNGO
      *C      CHANGED FOR DATE EXPANSION FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C      RECOMPILED TO PICK UP NEW FILE FORMAT.
      *C
      *C JUNE 6, 1996 - JEFF BUNGO
      *C      CHECK DOCK-SPECIAL-PRINT PARAMETER, IF Y THEN DO
      *C      NORMAL PRINTING WITH ESCAPE SEQUENCES ELSE DO
      *C      PRINTING WITHOUT ANY ESCAPE SEQUENCES.
      *C*****************************************************************
003400 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
003500 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
003600 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
003700 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
003800 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
             SELECT MPORCV
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0101
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT DRCVITEM
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
003900 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MPORCV
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPORCV-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0100 OF MCFLCS0101.
       FD  DRCVITEM
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DRCVITEM-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1200 OF MCFLCS1201.
004000 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  SUB                             PIC 9(4).
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1               PIC X.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2               PIC X.

       01  ITEM-CODE.
           05  ITEM-MAJOR                  PIC X(2).
           05  FILLER                      PIC X(5).
       01  ITEM-SUB                        PIC 9(2).
       01  ITEM-FOUND                      PIC X(1).
004100
004110*01  RCVR-PRINT-ITEMS            PIC X(40) VALUE SPACES.
       01  RCVR-PRINT-ITEMS.
           05  RCVR-ITEM OCCURS 999 TIMES PIC X(4).
004200 COPY RCVPRT OF COPYLIB.
005000
005100 01  COUNT-AREA                    PIC X(24) VALUE SPACES.
005200 COPY DBPOARG1 OF COPYLIB.
005300*---------- VSETERROR AND VPUTWINDOW
005400 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER            PIC X(76)    VALUE SPACES.
005500 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER-RD REDEFINES MESSAGE-BUFFER.
005600     05  MSG-BUFFER            PIC X(68).
005700     05  MSG-VALUE             PIC X(8).
005800 01  MESSAGE-BUFLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE 76 COMP-4.
005900 01  MESSAGE-ACTLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE 0  COMP-4.
006000 01  FIELD-NUMBER              PIC S9(4)    VALUE 1  COMP-4.
006100
006200 COPY TBLOWUP  OF COPYLIB.
006300 COPY TSHWRDFM OF COPYLIB.
006400 COPY DBSTAT OF COPYLIB.
006500 COPY DBMODES OF COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD OF COPYLIB.
       01  RS-ARG                    PIC X(14).
007000
007100 COPY MPORCV OF COPYLIB.
       COPY DRCVITEM OF COPYLIB.
007200
007300 01  FORM-NAMES.
007400     05  RSREPRT               PIC X(7)     VALUE "RSREPRT".
007500
       01  SCREEN-BUFFER             PIC X(2000).
007600*----------  SCREEN BUFFER
007700 01  SCREEN-BUFFERX.
007800     05  DE-PO.
007900         10  DE-END             PIC XXX.
008000         10  FILLER             PIC X(4).
008100     05  DE-RLSE                PIC XXX.
008200     05  DE-RS                  PIC XXX.
008201     05  DE-ITEM-AREA.
008210         07  DE-ITEM OCCURS 10 TIMES PIC X(4).
           05  DE-COMMAND-LINE        PIC X(79).
           05  DE-MESSAGE-LINE        PIC X(79).
008300 LINKAGE SECTION.
008400 COPY VCOMLINK OF COPYLIB.
       01  BASE-MMISA                 PIC X(24).
008500 COPY DOCKMISC OF COPYLIB.
008600 COPY LANGSUB  OF COPYLIB.
008700 COPY ESCNAME  OF COPYLIB.
       01  RAW-MATERIAL-GROUP.
           07  RM-GROUP OCCURS 6 TIMES PIC X(2).
008800
008900*************************************************************
009000*************************************************************'
009100*                   MAIN PARAGRAGH                          *
009200*     OPEN ALL FILES AND DISPLAY THE SCREEN REQUESTING      *
009300*     A RECEIVING SLIP NUMBER.  VALIDATE THAT THE RECEIVING *
009400*     SLIP EXISTS.  IF IT DOES, CALL SUBROUTINE "TRSPRT"    *
009500*     TO ACTUALLY RETRIEVE ALL INFORMATION FROM DATABASE    *
009600*     AND PRINT THE RECEIVING SLIP.  CONTINUE PROCESSING    *
009700*     REPRINTS UNTIL USER EXITS PROGRAM.  CLOSE FILES.      *
009800*************************************************************
009900*************************************************************
010000 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING VIEW-COMAREA, BASE-MMISA,
010000                          MISCELLANEOUS-DATA,
010100                          LANGUAGE-PARMS, ESC-NAME
                                RAW-MATERIAL-GROUP.
010200 00-MAIN.
010210     MOVE SPACES TO SCREEN-BUFFERX, SCREEN-BUFFER.
010300     MOVE SPACES TO RCVR-PRINT-PARAMETERS,
010310                     MISC-FRT-COMMENT RCVR-PRINT-ITEMS.
010400
           OPEN INPUT MPORCV
                      DRCVITEM.
010500     PERFORM 200-REPRINT-RECEIVING-SLIP THRU 299-EXIT.
010600     CLOSE MPORCV
                 DRCVITEM.
010700     GOBACK.
010800*************************************************************
010900*        DISPLAY SCREEN THAT REQUESTS A RECEIVER            *
011000*        NUMBER.  VALIDATE THAT THE RECEIVER EXISTS.        *
011100*        IF IT DOES, CALL SUBROUTINE "CRSPRT" TO PRINT      *
011200*        THE RECEIVER.                                      *
011300*************************************************************
011400 200-REPRINT-RECEIVING-SLIP.
011500     MOVE RSREPRT       TO VIEW-NFNAME.
013000
           MOVE "000" TO DE-RLSE, DE-RS.
           MOVE "0000" TO DE-ITEM (1) DE-ITEM (2) DE-ITEM (3)
                          DE-ITEM (4) DE-ITEM (5) DE-ITEM (6)
                          DE-ITEM (7) DE-ITEM (8) DE-ITEM (9)
                          DE-ITEM (10).
013100 205-DISPLAY-RECEIVING-SCREEN.
013200     MOVE 7 TO SRF-KEYSET.
           MOVE SCREEN-BUFFERX TO SCREEN-BUFFER.
013300*---------- CALL SUBPROG WHICH WILL HANDLE THE SHOWFORM,
013400*---------- READFIELDS, SPECIAL KEY LOGIC (FLOP SCREEN, PRINT
013500*---------- SCREEN, REFRESH, ETC), AND VIEW EDITS.
013600     CALL "TSHWRDFM" USING SRF-COMAREA, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
013700       VIEW-COMAREA, BASE, STATUS-AREA, SRF-SPOOLER-REC,
013800       LANGUAGE-PARMS, SCREEN-BUFFER.
013900     IF SRF-RET-CODE NOT = 0
014000        MOVE "TSHWRDF2 ERROR 205 CRSPRTS" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
014100        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
           MOVE SCREEN-BUFFER TO SCREEN-BUFFERX.
014200
014300     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
014400        GO TO 299-EXIT.
015200
015300*----------  CHECK IF RECEIVER EXISTS
015400     MOVE "P"                    TO   WS-PO-INDIC.
015500     MOVE DE-PO                  TO   WS-PO.
015600     MOVE DE-RLSE                TO   WS-RLSE.
015700     MOVE DE-RS                  TO   WS-RS.
015800     MOVE WS-RECEIVER            TO   RS-ARG.
015900
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE RS-ARG TO PORCVNO OF MPORCV-REC.
           READ MPORCV INTO BUF-MPORCV
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
016200     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
016300         IF NO-ENTRY
016400*            ***  PURCHASE ORDER DOES NOT EXIST  ***
016500             MOVE  16 TO LANG-SETNUM
016600             MOVE  45 TO LANG-MSGNUM
016700             PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
016800             PERFORM  940-VSETERROR  THRU  949-EXIT
016900             GO TO 205-DISPLAY-RECEIVING-SCREEN
017000         ELSE
017100           MOVE "READ MPORCV SRSPRTS"      TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
017200           PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.

           PERFORM 300-CHECK-RAW THRU 300-EXIT.
017300
017400*    *** NOW PROCESSING ***
017500*    MOVE  14 TO LANG-SETNUM.
017600*    MOVE   2 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
017700*    PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
017800*    PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT.
018400     MOVE RS-ARG                TO MISC-RS-ARG.
018410     MOVE "Y"                   TO MISC-REPRINT.
018420     MOVE DE-ITEM-AREA  TO RCVR-PRINT-ITEMS.
           PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 11 BY 1 UNTIL SUB > 999
               MOVE "0000" TO RCVR-ITEM(SUB)
           END-PERFORM.
           IF DOCK-SPECIAL-PRINT = "Y"
               CALL "CRSPRT" USING BASE-MMISA,
                                   MISCELLANEOUS-DATA,
                                   RCVR-PRINT-PARAMETERS,
                                   RCVR-PRINT-ITEMS,
                                   VIEW-COMAREA,
                                   LANGUAGE-PARMS,
                                   COUNT-AREA,
                                   ESC-NAME
           ELSE
               CALL "CRSPRT2" USING BASE-MMISA,
                                   MISCELLANEOUS-DATA,
                                   RCVR-PRINT-PARAMETERS,
                                   RCVR-PRINT-ITEMS,
                                   VIEW-COMAREA,
                                   LANGUAGE-PARMS,
                                   COUNT-AREA,
                                   ESC-NAME
           END-IF.
019100
019200     GO TO 200-REPRINT-RECEIVING-SLIP.
019300
019400 299-EXIT.  EXIT.

      ****************************************************
      * CHECK IF RECEIVING SLIP SHOULD BE PRINTED ON RAW *
      * MATERIAL PRINTER BY CHECKING EACH ITEM FOR A RAW *
      * MATERIAL MAJOR GROUP AS DEFINED IN PLANT SET UP. *
      ****************************************************
       300-CHECK-RAW.
           MOVE RS-ARG TO PORCVNO OF DRCVITEM-REC.
           START DRCVITEM KEY = PORCVNO OF DRCVITEM-REC
             INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
           END-START.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              GO TO 300-EXIT.
       300-NEXT-ITEM.
           READ DRCVITEM NEXT INTO BUF-DRCVITEM
             AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
           END-READ.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              GO TO 300-EXIT.
           IF RS-ARG NOT = RCV-PO-RCV-NO
              GO TO 300-EXIT.
           IF DE-ITEM-AREA NOT = ZEROS
               MOVE "N" TO ITEM-FOUND
               MOVE 1 TO ITEM-SUB
               PERFORM UNTIL ITEM-FOUND = "Y" OR ITEM-SUB > 10
                 IF RCV-ITEM-NUMBER = DE-ITEM (ITEM-SUB)
                    MOVE "Y" TO ITEM-FOUND
                 ELSE
                    ADD 1 TO ITEM-SUB
                 END-IF
               END-PERFORM
               IF ITEM-FOUND NOT = "Y"
                  GO TO 300-EXIT
               END-IF
           END-IF.
           MOVE RCV-CORP-CODE TO ITEM-CODE.
           IF  ITEM-MAJOR = RM-GROUP (1) OR RM-GROUP (2) OR
                            RM-GROUP (3) OR RM-GROUP (4) OR
                            RM-GROUP (5) OR RM-GROUP (6)
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  RAW-MAT-PRINT
           ELSE
               GO TO 300-NEXT-ITEM.
       300-EXIT.
           EXIT.
019500
020400******************************************************************
020500*   DISPLAY ERROR MESSAGE FOR SPECIFIC FIELD ON INVENTORY SCREEN *
020600******************************************************************
020700 940-VSETERROR.
           MOVE "Y" TO SRF-ERROR-SW.
           MOVE B"1" TO IND (FIELD-NUMBER).
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE-MESSAGE-LINE.
051300
022100 949-EXIT.  EXIT.
022200************************************************************
022300*                    B L O W U P                           *
022400*     CHECK FOR IMAGE, VIEW, OR SPOOL ERROR.  CLOSE        *
022500*     FILES, GET OUT OF BLOCK MODE, AND DISPLAY            *
022600*     APPROPRIATE ERROR MESSAGE ON SCREEN.                 *
022700*                                                          *
022800*     ALSO APPENDS THE ERROR MESSAGE TO A FILE CALLED      *
022900*     BLOWUP.PUB.  TO READ THIS FILE, RUN "XBLPRT.OBJECT". *
023000*                                                          *
023100*         |||  PROGRAM IS ABORTED IN TBLOWUP  |||          *
023200************************************************************
023300 990-BLOWUP.
023400     MOVE "CRSPRTS" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
023500     MOVE VIEW-NFNAME TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
023600     MOVE RS-ARG      TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2).
023700     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
023800           VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
023900           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
024000 999-EXIT.  EXIT.
024100
024200 999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
025800 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
025900     EXIT.
